OpenPlod BLE materials vendored / adapted for Plaud-local
==========================================================

This directory contains the ``plaud-bridge`` Rust crate copied from OpenPlod
and used as the selective Bluetooth radio helper for Plaud-local.

Upstream
--------
- Project: https://github.com/RemiPelloux/OpenPlod
- Revision: d5c27989b05837cd49ff7780595514e133bd1c0d
- License: MIT (see LICENSE in this directory)
- Copyright: 2026 Remi Pelloux and OpenPlod contributors

OpenPlod documents derivation from ``jddavenportOpen/openplaud``. The
openplaud standalone LICENSE file was unavailable when OpenPlod recorded
provenance (2026-09-07). Plaud-local ships OpenPlod MIT contributions with
attribution; residual openplaud provenance risk is accepted by the product
owner for this adapter.

Not included
------------
- OpenPlod vault / UI / transcription / MCP / Tauri chrome
- Plaud SDK AAR binaries or trademarks
- Android companion enrollment

Python protocol / provision / crypto / audio modules adapted from OpenPlod
``src/sync/*`` live under ``src/localplaud/ble/`` with SPDX-style file headers
pointing at the OpenPlod sources.

